/*  A function returns a new series holding its parameter.
    Obligation broken: O1, what is read must not be deeper than the checker thinks. See docs/SOUNDNESS.md.  */

Bind series of series of number to wrap, given (the series of number s):
    Define result as a series of series of number.
    Insert s into result.
    Return result.
Done.
Define outer as a series of series of number.
Pull a rabbit.
    Define inner as a series of number with (1, 2, 3).
    outer becomes cast wrap on (inner).
Done.

/*  Make and drop enough values that freed memory is handed out again. */
Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State outer.
